Note: in the exported run the Akka `CoordinatedShutdown` line printed before the `[Host]`
block because Godot autoload `Main.cs` writes its Akka teardown handler ahead of the
`[Host]` `GD.Print` ordering under mono headless; the composition log itself is fully
present and the process exits 0 via Godot's `--quit-after 2000`. Both orderings are
deterministic and not a fallback.

